stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Acquire
    Acquire --> Sample: same record flock
    Sample --> Publish: generation memo and doctor JSON
    Publish --> Release: rename completed
    Release --> Claim: exact attempt and generation
    Claim --> Proof: persisted then cancelled then persisted
    Proof --> Settle: matching attempt remains Awaiting
    Settle --> Observe: release lock before HTTP
    Observe --> Consume: acceptance plus same attempt
    Consume --> [*]
